t(38, 150, """… I was asked about sorcerers who invent things that contradict every explicit text .. The leadership center of the coming Islamic world is not Marrakesh, nor Algiers, nor Khartoum, nor Tunis, nor Cairo, nor Baghdad, nor Damascus, nor Istanbul .. These are inventions they simply make up, and they have followers who sold their minds and cheer for ignorance. What can be expected of one who sold his mind! Everyone who contradicts explicit texts has sold his mind! But many people love illusions and fight to the death defending them and composing them out of nothing .. Now a jafr composed by devils, now scraps and clippings .. O son of Adam, understand .. There is a religious, hadith text, with a sound chain, mutawatir, on which the whole Ummah agrees, about the center of rule of the Islamic world .. Understand, O son of Adam, and enough spreading ignorance among people .. The words are general .. for everyone who spreads ignorance""")

t(38, 755, """Take all the cities and their noise .. As for me and my wife, we have seen everything in your cities .. We long for faraway evenings .. Neighbors and companionship: this one our Egyptian neighbor, that one our Palestinian neighbor, behind us lives an Algerian and beside him a Yemeni, and in front of us, down the mountain, houses with people from all the Muslim lands .. We are elderly .. Take all the cities and take their noise""")

